  {
   "id": "ancient-weapon-holly-264162@1.1",
   "gameId": "ancient-weapon-holly-264162",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2024-03-09T09:42:58.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[ver1.1] Player direction adjustment during controller operation",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have fixed the following problems reported by many players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. The direction of the player when operating the controller has been made easier to determine.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There was a slight lag when the player's direction was changed.: 2. The sensitivity of the player's direction can be customized from 0 to 100 in the option menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now play with the value you prefer.: 3. Fixed a bug that sometimes prevented jumping while moving.: We apologize for any inconvenience this may have caused.: In order to improve the operability with the controller, we would appreciate it if you could report the same phenomenon on Discord, SteamCommunity, etc.: Discord: https://discord.gg/ajawXaQqnK: SteamCommunity: https://steamcommunity.com/app/2403260/discussions/",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
